            <title><![CDATA[Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War IV – Orks Faction Trailer | Warhammer]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/fdstk58a/warhammer-40000-dawn-of-war-iv-orks-faction-trailer-warhammer</link>
            <guid>fdstk58a</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Dakka is louder, choppas hit harder, an' the boyz head into war on a massive scale – check out this first full gameplay look into the Orks in Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War IV! 

For Orks, war is loud, anarchic, and gloriously violent. It's all about taking on the biggest and baddest, krumping the enemy, and, most importantly, having a darn good scrap! In-game, the Orks make use of a number of tactical units and their unique Waaagh! ability to turn the tide on the battlefield.

Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War IV releases on Steam in 2026!]]></description>
